NIHAMALOK’ILA INDRAY NY LANITRA
MANJOMBON-TAKARIVA MASOANDRO SASATRA
NY VOLON-DRAHONA INY TSY HAY TAZANINA
NIPAIKA ITY ILAY ORA FITSAHARANA

NIKOPAKA NY AROSY TSY HAY NOTANANA
HANGINA NY KAMORY NILAOZA-NAMANA
FA TRATRA HARIVA IRERY ANTAN’OLONA
TOMANY FA TE HODY RAVALOVOTAKA

HATREO ALOHA NY ANIO KA ALEO FARANANA
IZAY VITA NO IFALIO FA TAM-PITIAVANA
RAHA MISY ALAHELO TONEO TSY HIRARAKA
NY RANOMASO FERO TSY HIPATRAPATRAKA

SATRIKO NY HITOETRA TSY HIFANDAO LALA O
VOATERY HIFAMETRA FA LAVI-DALANA
DIAVOLAN-KO LAVA
LALAO KOA MBOLA HO ELA
MBOLA HIFANATRI-TAVA
IZAY NO EFA NEKENA
